<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>PumperBros — Two instruments for reading your body</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;0,6..72,600;1,6..72,400;1,6..72,500&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 160 160'%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient id='g' x1='0%25' y1='0%25' x2='100%25' y2='100%25'%3E%3Cstop offset='0%25' stop-color='%23FF6B4A'/%3E%3Cstop offset='100%25' stop-color='%233B1F2E'/%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect width='160' height='160' rx='34' fill='url(%23g)'/%3E%3Ctext x='80' y='96' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Arial Black, Arial, sans-serif' font-weight='800' font-size='64' fill='%23fff'%3EPB%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#221E19;
    --ink-soft:#6B6459;
    --paper:#F3EEE3;
    --paper-panel:#FFFDF8;
    --line:#DDD5C3;
    --line-strong:#221E19;

    --marea:#8C3B52;
    --marea-tint:#F3E3E6;
    --marea-soft:#B87086;

    --strata:#1F5C52;
    --strata-tint:#DEEAE4;
    --strata-soft:#5C9186;

    --brand-coral:#FF6B4A;
    --brand-plum:#3B1F2E;

    --radius:16px;
    --display:'Newsreader', serif;
    --sans:'Work Sans', sans-serif;
    --mono:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); font-family:var(--sans); line-height:1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  img,svg{display:block; max-width:100%;}
  a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}
  ul{list-style:none;}
  button{font-family:inherit; cursor:pointer;}
  :focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ink); outline-offset:3px;}

  .wrap{max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 32px;}
  section{padding:100px 0;}

  .eyebrow{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--ink-soft); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{content:""; width:20px; height:2px; background:var(--ink);}

  h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--display); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:-0.01em; color:var(--ink);}

  /* HEADER */
  header{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background:rgba(243,238,227,.92); backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav.wrap{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding-top:20px; padding-bottom:20px;}
  .logo{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; font-family:var(--display); font-style:italic; font-weight:500; font-size:24px;}
  .logo .brand-bros{color:var(--brand-coral); font-style:normal; font-weight:700;}
  .logo-mark{
    width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:8px; flex-shrink:0;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand-coral) 0%, var(--brand-plum) 100%);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-family:'Work Sans', sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:12px; color:#fff;
    letter-spacing:-0.5px;
  }
  .logo-mark::before{content:"PB";}
  .nav-links{display:flex; gap:34px; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:500;}
  .nav-links a{color:var(--ink-soft); transition:color .15s ease;}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--ink);}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    padding:12px 22px; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; border-radius:999px;
    border:1.5px solid var(--ink); transition:transform .15s ease, background .15s ease, color .15s ease;
  }
  .btn-dark{background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper);}
  .btn-dark:hover{transform:translateY(-1px); opacity:.88;}
  .btn-outline{background:transparent; color:var(--ink);}
  .btn-outline:hover{background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper);}

  /* HERO */
  .hero{padding-top:80px; padding-bottom:60px; text-align:center;}
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(38px,5.4vw,68px); line-height:1.08; font-weight:500;
    max-width:820px; margin:0 auto;
  }
  .hero h1 em{font-style:italic; color:var(--marea);}
  .hero h1 .amp{color:var(--strata); font-style:italic;}
  .hero p.lead{
    margin:26px auto 0; font-size:18px; color:var(--ink-soft); max-width:520px;
  }

  /* TABLE OF CONTENTS */
  .toc{margin-top:64px;}
  .toc ul{max-width:640px; margin:0 auto; border-top:1px solid var(--line-strong);}
  .toc li{
    display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:14px;
    padding:22px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong);
    font-family:var(--display); font-size:20px;
  }
  .toc li a{display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:14px; width:100%;}
  .toc .vol{font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-soft); letter-spacing:.06em; width:80px; flex-shrink:0; text-align:left;}
  .toc .name{flex-shrink:0;}
  .toc .name em{font-style:italic;}
  .toc .dots{flex:1; border-bottom:1px dotted var(--ink-soft); transform:translateY(-6px);}
  .toc .tag{font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-soft); flex-shrink:0;}
  .toc li:hover{color:var(--marea);}
  .toc li:nth-child(2):hover{color:var(--strata);}

  /* APP SECTIONS */
  .app-section{border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
  .app-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:.95fr 1.05fr; gap:64px; align-items:center;}
  .app-grid.reverse{grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;}
  .app-grid.reverse .app-copy{order:2;}
  .app-grid.reverse .app-visual{order:1;}

  .vol-label{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase;
    display:inline-block; padding:5px 12px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .app-copy h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3.4vw,44px); margin-bottom:18px;}
  .app-copy p.desc{color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:16px; max-width:440px; margin-bottom:30px;}
  .app-feature-list{margin-bottom:34px;}
  .app-feature-list li{
    display:flex; gap:12px; padding:10px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); font-size:14.5px;
  }
  .app-feature-list li:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .app-feature-list b{font-weight:600;}
  .app-feature-list span{color:var(--ink-soft);}

  /* App visual card (shared shape, colored per app) */
  .app-visual{display:flex; justify-content:center;}
  .visual-card{
    background:var(--paper-panel); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:34px; width:100%; max-width:380px;
    box-shadow:0 30px 70px -40px rgba(34,30,25,.35);
  }
  .visual-head{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:20px;}
  .visual-head .app-name{font-family:var(--display); font-style:italic; font-size:20px;}
  .visual-head .dot-chip{width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%;}
  .dial-wrap{position:relative; width:200px; height:200px; margin:0 auto;}
  .dial-wrap svg{width:100%; height:100%;}
  .dial-center{position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;}
  .dial-center .big{font-family:var(--display); font-weight:600; font-size:30px;}
  .dial-center .small{font-family:var(--mono); font-size:10.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:4px;}
  .dial-seg{stroke-linecap:round; transform-origin:center;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference){
    .dial-seg{stroke-dasharray:471; stroke-dashoffset:471; animation:filldial 1.2s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) forwards;}
    .dial-seg.d1{animation-delay:.05s;} .dial-seg.d2{animation-delay:.25s;}
    .dial-seg.d3{animation-delay:.45s;} .dial-seg.d4{animation-delay:.65s;}
  }
  @keyframes filldial{to{stroke-dashoffset:var(--dash-target);}}
  .visual-legend{display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:16px; margin-top:22px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .visual-legend li{font-family:var(--mono); font-size:10.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;}
  .visual-legend .dot{width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%;}

  /* PHILOSOPHY / SHARED */
  .philosophy{border-top:1px solid var(--line); text-align:center;}
  .philosophy h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.2vw,42px); max-width:640px; margin:0 auto 20px;}
  .philosophy p{color:var(--ink-soft); max-width:560px; margin:0 auto; font-size:16px;}
  .philosophy-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1px; background:var(--line); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); overflow:hidden; margin-top:56px; text-align:left;}
  .phil-item{background:var(--paper-panel); padding:32px 28px;}
  .phil-item .num{font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .phil-item h3{font-size:19px; margin:12px 0 8px; font-weight:500;}
  .phil-item p{font-size:14px; color:var(--ink-soft); max-width:none; margin:0;}

  /* TESTIMONIALS */
  .testi-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:24px; margin-top:56px;}
  .testi{background:var(--paper-panel); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:28px;}
  .testi .badge{
    display:inline-block; font-family:var(--mono); font-size:10.5px; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .testi p.quote{font-family:var(--display); font-style:italic; font-size:19px; line-height:1.35;}
  .testi .who{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-top:20px; padding-top:16px; border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
  .avatar{width:32px; height:32px; border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-family:var(--mono); font-weight:600; font-size:11px; color:var(--paper);}
  .who small{display:block; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:12px;}
  .who b{font-size:13.5px;}

  /* CTA */
  .cta-split{border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
  .cta-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:24px;}
  .cta-card{
    border-radius:20px; padding:52px 44px; color:#fff; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between; min-height:260px;
  }
  .cta-card h3{color:#fff; font-size:28px; margin-bottom:12px;}
  .cta-card p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.82); font-size:14.5px; max-width:280px;}
  .cta-card .btn{margin-top:28px; align-self:flex-start; border-color:#fff;}
  .cta-card .btn-dark{background:#fff;}
  .cta-card.marea{background:var(--marea);}
  .cta-card.marea .btn-dark{color:var(--marea);}
  .cta-card.strata{background:var(--strata);}
  .cta-card.strata .btn-dark{color:var(--strata);}

  /* FOOTER */
  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:56px 0 32px;}
  .foot-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.4fr repeat(3,1fr); gap:40px; padding-bottom:40px;}
  .foot-grid h4{font-size:12.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:16px; font-family:var(--mono);}
  .foot-grid li{margin-bottom:10px; font-size:14px;}
  .foot-grid li a:hover{color:var(--marea);}
  .foot-grid p{color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:14px; max-width:280px; margin-top:14px;}
  .foot-bottom{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; padding-top:24px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-family:var(--mono);}

  @media (max-width:940px){
    .nav-links{display:none;}
    .app-grid, .app-grid.reverse{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:44px;}
    .app-grid.reverse .app-copy{order:1;}
    .app-grid.reverse .app-visual{order:2;}
    .philosophy-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .testi-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .cta-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .toc .vol{width:60px;}
  }
  @media (max-width:600px){
    .wrap{padding:0 20px;}
    section{padding:64px 0;}
    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .toc li{font-size:16px;}
    .toc .vol{display:none;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <nav class="wrap">
    <a href="#" class="logo"><span class="logo-mark"></span>Pumper<span class="brand-bros">Bros</span></a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#marea">Marea</a></li>
      <li><a href="#strata">Strata</a></li>
      <li><a href="#philosophy">Philosophy</a></li>
      <li><a href="#reviews">Reviews</a></li>
    </ul>
    <a href="#get" class="btn btn-dark">Get Both Apps</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;">Two apps, one publisher</p>
      <h1>Two instruments for<br>reading your <em>body</em> <span class="amp">&</span> its <em>changes.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">PumperBros makes two focused tracking apps — one for your cycle, one for your skin. Different rhythms, same idea: quiet, daily logging that adds up to real insight.</p>

      <div class="toc">
        <ul>
          <li>
            <a href="#marea">
              <span class="vol">Vol. I</span>
              <span class="name">Marea — <em>cycle tracking</em></span>
              <span class="dots"></span>
              <span class="tag">Explore →</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#strata">
              <span class="vol">Vol. II</span>
              <span class="name">Strata — <em>skin repair tracking</em></span>
              <span class="dots"></span>
              <span class="tag">Explore →</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MAREA -->
  <section class="app-section" id="marea">
    <div class="wrap app-grid">
      <div class="app-copy">
        <span class="vol-label" style="background:var(--marea-tint); color:var(--marea);">Vol. I — Marea</span>
        <h2>Your body moves in <em style="color:var(--marea); font-style:italic;">tides.</em> Track them.</h2>
        <p class="desc">Marea learns your rhythm — period, fertile window, and everything in between — so you always know where you stand, without the guesswork.</p>
        <ul class="app-feature-list">
          <li><b>Smart predictions</b><span>— sharper with every logged cycle</span></li>
          <li><b>Symptom log</b><span>— flow, mood, and energy in one tap</span></li>
          <li><b>Private by design</b><span>— encrypted, on-device, no ads</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline" style="border-color:var(--marea); color:var(--marea);">Explore Marea →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="app-visual">
        <div class="visual-card">
          <div class="visual-head">
            <span class="app-name">Marea</span>
            <span class="dot-chip" style="background:var(--marea);"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="dial-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200">
              <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="75" fill="none" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="14"/>
              <circle class="dial-seg d1" cx="100" cy="100" r="75" fill="none" stroke="#8C3B52" stroke-width="14" style="--dash-target:390" transform="rotate(-90 100 100)"/>
              <circle class="dial-seg d2" cx="100" cy="100" r="75" fill="none" stroke="#C08A63" stroke-width="14" style="--dash-target:340" transform="rotate(23 100 100)"/>
              <circle class="dial-seg d3" cx="100" cy="100" r="75" fill="none" stroke="#7E9B7A" stroke-width="14" style="--dash-target:433" transform="rotate(103 100 100)"/>
              <circle class="dial-seg d4" cx="100" cy="100" r="75" fill="none" stroke="#5E3040" stroke-width="14" style="--dash-target:262" transform="rotate(140 100 100)"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="dial-center">
              <div class="big">Day 14</div>
              <div class="small">Ovulation</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="visual-legend">
            <li><span class="dot" style="background:#8C3B52"></span>Menstrual</li>
            <li><span class="dot" style="background:#C08A63"></span>Follicular</li>
            <li><span class="dot" style="background:#7E9B7A"></span>Ovulation</li>
            <li><span class="dot" style="background:#5E3040"></span>Luteal</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STRATA -->
  <section class="app-section" id="strata">
    <div class="wrap app-grid reverse">
      <div class="app-visual">
        <div class="visual-card">
          <div class="visual-head">
            <span class="app-name">Strata</span>
            <span class="dot-chip" style="background:var(--strata);"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="dial-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200">
              <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="75" fill="none" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="14"/>
              <circle class="dial-seg d1" cx="100" cy="100" r="75" fill="none" stroke="#1F5C52" stroke-width="14" style="--dash-target:94" transform="rotate(-90 100 100)"/>
              <circle class="dial-seg d2" cx="100" cy="100" r="75" fill="none" stroke="#C79A4B" stroke-width="14" style="--dash-target:259" transform="rotate(-9 100 100)"/>
              <circle class="dial-seg d3" cx="100" cy="100" r="75" fill="none" stroke="#B4573D" stroke-width="14" style="--dash-target:377" transform="rotate(80 100 100)"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="dial-center">
              <div class="big">82</div>
              <div class="small">Barrier Score</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="visual-legend">
            <li><span class="dot" style="background:#1F5C52"></span>Hydration</li>
            <li><span class="dot" style="background:#C79A4B"></span>Texture</li>
            <li><span class="dot" style="background:#B4573D"></span>Redness</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="app-copy">
        <span class="vol-label" style="background:var(--strata-tint); color:var(--strata);">Vol. II — Strata</span>
        <h2>Every layer of repair, <em style="color:var(--strata); font-style:italic;">measured.</em></h2>
        <p class="desc">Strata logs your routine, redness, hydration, and texture side by side — so you can finally see what's working on your skin, not just hope it is.</p>
        <ul class="app-feature-list">
          <li><b>Photo timeline</b><span>— weekly progress, aligned and compared</span></li>
          <li><b>AM/PM routine</b><span>— step-by-step, with reminders that fit</span></li>
          <li><b>Trigger insights</b><span>— link flare-ups to products, diet, sleep</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline" style="border-color:var(--strata); color:var(--strata);">Explore Strata →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PHILOSOPHY -->
  <section class="philosophy" id="philosophy">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;">Why two apps, not one</p>
      <h2>Different rhythms deserve different instruments.</h2>
      <p>A cycle runs in weeks. Skin repair runs in months. We built Marea and Strata separately so each app's rhythm, reminders, and insights actually match what they're tracking — instead of forcing both into one generic log.</p>

      <div class="philosophy-grid">
        <div class="phil-item">
          <p class="num">01</p>
          <h3>Built for one thing</h3>
          <p>Each app is designed around a single body system, not a catch-all dashboard.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="phil-item">
          <p class="num">02</p>
          <h3>Shared privacy standard</h3>
          <p>Both apps encrypt data on-device and never sell it — no exceptions, no fine print.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="phil-item">
          <p class="num">03</p>
          <h3>Independent, or together</h3>
          <p>Use one app or both — they don't require each other, but they're built by the same small team.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
  <section id="reviews" style="border-top:1px solid var(--line);">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div style="text-align:center; max-width:560px; margin:0 auto;">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;">Reviews</p>
        <h2>Real feedback goes here.</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:14px; font-size:15px;">Sample content below — replace with your own reviews before launch.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="testi-grid">
        <div class="testi">
          <span class="badge" style="background:var(--marea-tint); color:var(--marea);">Marea</span>
          <p class="quote">"First app that predicted my period on the exact day. The insights actually explain why."</p>
          <div class="who"><span class="avatar" style="background:#8C3B52">RM</span><div><b>Riya M.</b><small>Sample user</small></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="testi">
          <span class="badge" style="background:var(--strata-tint); color:var(--strata);">Strata</span>
          <p class="quote">"Six weeks of photos side by side finally showed me the retinol was actually working."</p>
          <div class="who"><span class="avatar" style="background:#1F5C52">NP</span><div><b>Nadia P.</b><small>Sample user</small></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-split" id="get">
